# Frozen research artifacts are published BYTE-IDENTICAL to the originals, and
# PROVENANCE.md invites you to verify their hashes. Line-ending conversion would
# silently break that: Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which
# would hand a cloner CRLF copies whose sha256 no longer matches the frozen
# record. These files are therefore never converted, on any platform.
research/** -text

# Binary assets: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.gif  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.wasm binary
